  annotation = {中文辅助译名：猪个体识别及自动称重系统的研究},
  abstract = {This article takes pig individual identification and automatic weight collecting as an example, analyzes the data collecting process in the healthy pig feeding system. In this essay, the writer suggests to use RF devices to identify every pig and collect the weight automatically and save it in the database so as to analyze. It also discusses the basic theory of coordination between pig individual identification and automatic weight collecting, and analyzes the characteristics of this system and its appLication prospects to achieve healthy feeding.},
